<title>USA: CUNO files for 2 million share offering.</title>
<headline>CUNO files for 2 million share offering.</headline>
<dateline>MERIDEN, Conn. 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>CUNO Inc said Thursday it filed a Registration Statement with the Securities and Exchange Commission for the proposed offering of two million shares of common stock.</p>
<p>Proceeds will be used to repay debt and for working capital and general corporate purposes.</p>
<p>The managing underwriters for the offering will be Robert W. Baird &amp; Co Inc, Cleary Gull Reiland &amp; McDevitt Inc and Goldman, Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
